<title>USA: IKON may buy back up to 5 pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>IKON may buy back up to 5 pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY FORGE, Pa. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>IKON Office Solutions Inc said Thursday it may buy back up to five percent of its outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe our shares are currently undervalued in the market, and the price is attractive,&quot; Chairman and Chief Executive Officer John Stuart said in a statement.</p>
<p>Stuart said the company plans to use the repurchased shares primarily in its acquisition program.</p>
</text>
